# Only what the image needs: the package, its lockfile, and the generic prompts.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!src/
# The two generic prompts by name, as `.gitignore` does. A personal prompt left
# in a working copy must not ride along into a pushed image.
!prompts/system.md
!prompts/user.md

# Belt and braces. The patterns above already exclude these, but this file is
# the last thing standing between a secret and a layer that gets pushed.
**/.env
**/config.yml
**/policy.yml
**/secrets/
**/log/
**/.state/
**/__pycache__/
